{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C] Kinda like an [G]old jon [F]boat on some large mouth wa[C]ter[G][F]
[C] Kinda like that [G]breeze that [F]blows through a sweet home hol[C]ler[G]  [F]  [C/E]    [Dm11]I   can't leave your lovin' alone
[G]  [Dm11]Where you are is where I belong[G]
{end_of_verse}


{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
